{"title":"Ashsworn Pyromancer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 59 Ashsworn that attacks with burn (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>14</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>156</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>81</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>343</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>37</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.